单个节点的连接生命周期：
t=0:    canConnect=true → 发起连接 → 进入 CONNECTING 状态
        此时 isPreparingConnection=true, canConnect=false
        
t=0~10s: CONNECTING 状态持续（等待 socket.connection.setup.timeout.ms）
         leastLoadedNode 走 isPreparingConnection 分支 → foundConnecting = node
         
t=10s:  连接超时 → handleTimedOutConnections → processDisconnection
        → disconnected(nodeId, now):
          lastConnectAttemptMs = now (t=10s)
          updateReconnectBackoff → reconnectBackoffMs = backoff(failedAttempts)
          state = DISCONNECTED
        
t=10s ~ 10s+reconnectBackoffMs: DISCONNECTED + blackout
         canConnect=false, isPreparingConnection=false
         这是唯一的"不可选"（blackout）窗口
         
t=10s+reconnectBackoffMs: canConnect=true → 又可以被选中了
